# Godot Game Dev Studio Cursor rule

This repository contains 189 Godot/game-development skills. Do not load them all at once.

For Godot tasks:

1. Start from `SKILL_CATALOG.md` or `skills_index.json`.
2. Select the smallest relevant skill.
3. Read `skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md`.
4. Read only the required references.
5. Use Godot 4.7+ APIs and statically typed GDScript when generating code.
6. Preserve credits in `NOTICE.md` and license terms in `LICENSE`.

Use `studio-router` or `godot-master` for broad planning. Use specialist skills for implementation.
